🚽 Test case: round-19 review finding #2 -- execute_native_call()'s
🚽 total_args == 0 fast path (stdrot.c) previously skipped the STDROT_
🚽 STRING materialization the general (argc > 0) path already performs
🚽 unconditionally, reasoning that "no argument buffers exist to alias"
🚽 was still the operative invariant after the general path had already
🚽 moved past it. legacy_scratch_string() (tests/stdrot/testabi.c) is a
